\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Rafael Nadal's posterior ability path from 1{,}317 matches (top) and the law of its argmax (bottom). The path is one broad plateau and the argmax law is bimodal, at 2013 and 2018, with the seasons between them carrying almost no mass. The band in the top panel does not contain that statement, and no summary of the yearly marginals does either.}}{6}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:nadal}{{1}{6}{Rafael Nadal's posterior ability path from 1{,}317 matches (top) and the law of its argmax (bottom). The path is one broad plateau and the argmax law is bimodal, at 2013 and 2018, with the seasons between them carrying almost no mass. The band in the top panel does not contain that statement, and no summary of the yearly marginals does either}{figure.1}{}}
